---
import '../styles/companion.css';
import '../styles/yachiyo.css';
---
<script is:inline>
  // Before the avatar is parsed: saved minimization never flashes open on navigation.
  (() => { const read = (key) => { try { const backup = sessionStorage.getItem(key); if (backup !== null) return backup; } catch {} try { return localStorage.getItem(key); } catch { return null; } }; const hidden = read('moon-companion-hidden') === 'true', value = Number(read('moon-companion-scale')), scale = Number.isFinite(value) && value > 0 ? Math.max(.55, Math.min(1.2, value)) : .75; document.documentElement.dataset.companionVisibility = hidden ? 'hidden' : 'visible'; document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--companion-scale', String(scale)); })();
</script>
<div class="moon-companion" data-companion data-character-profile="yachiyo" data-state="idle" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <div class="companion-orbit" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
  <div class="companion-bubble" data-companion-bubble hidden role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><span class="companion-bubble-label">☾ 八千代</span><span class="companion-bubble-text" data-companion-bubble-text></span><button class="companion-bubble-close" type="button" data-companion-bubble-close aria-label="关闭台词气泡">×</button></div>
  <button class="companion-avatar" type="button" data-companion-avatar aria-label="轻触八千代互动并打开月面通信；也可拖动立绘调整位置" aria-controls="companion-panel" aria-expanded="false">
    <span class="companion-character" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="companion-character-orbit"></span>
      <span class="companion-live2d-stage"><canvas data-live2d-canvas width="256" height="400" aria-label="角色分层2D或Cubism模型画布"></canvas></span><span class="companion-portrait-stage"><img class="companion-doll" src="/live2d/models/Yachiyo/avatar.png" width="500" height="500" alt="" draggable="false" decoding="async"/></span>
      <span class="companion-character-caption" data-live2d-caption>YACHIYO / 八千代</span>
    </span>
    <span class="companion-name"><span data-live2d-name>八千代</span> <span class="companion-name-divider">/</span> 月面通信 <i data-companion-dot></i></span><span class="companion-observe-badge" data-companion-observe-badge hidden>站内观察中 · 可随时关闭</span>
    <span class="companion-thinking" aria-hidden="true">···</span>
  </button>
  <div class="companion-mini-actions"><button type="button" data-companion-wave aria-label="和小伙伴挥手">✦</button><button type="button" data-companion-hide aria-label="隐藏小伙伴（保留恢复按钮）">−</button></div>
</div>
<button class="companion-restore" data-companion-restore type="button" hidden aria-label="恢复月光小伙伴">☾ <span>唤醒小伙伴</span></button>
<section id="companion-panel" class="companion-panel" data-companion-panel data-character-profile="yachiyo" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="false" aria-labelledby="companion-title" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <header class="companion-panel-head"><span class="companion-face" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/live2d/models/Yachiyo/avatar.png" width="500" height="500" alt="" decoding="async"/></span><div class="companion-panel-title"><span class="companion-eyebrow">TSUKUYOMI · PRIVATE CHANNEL</span><h2 id="companion-title">八千代的月面通信 <span>✦</span></h2><p>灵感陪伴 / 非官方角色互动</p></div><button class="companion-close" type="button" data-companion-close aria-label="收起聊天面板">×</button></header>
  <div class="companion-connection"><div class="companion-connection-details"><span class="companion-service-label">MODEL CONNECTION</span><span data-companion-connection>八千代在这里陪你逛逛</span><small data-companion-model>公开版 · Live2D 与触摸互动</small></div></div>
  <div class="companion-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="小伙伴功能"><button type="button" role="tab" id="companion-chat-tab" aria-controls="companion-chat" aria-selected="true" data-companion-tab="chat"><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span> 对话</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="companion-observe-tab" aria-controls="companion-observe" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-companion-tab="observe"><span aria-hidden="true">☾</span> 观察</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="companion-info-tab" aria-controls="companion-info" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-companion-tab="info"><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span> 关于</button></div>
  <div class="companion-tab-body" id="companion-chat" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="companion-chat-tab">
    <div class="companion-chatlog" data-companion-chatlog role="log" aria-live="polite" aria-label="聊天消息"><div class="companion-welcome"><span class="companion-welcome-face companion-face" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/live2d/models/Yachiyo/avatar.png" width="500" height="500" alt="" decoding="async"/></span><span class="companion-eyebrow">A LITTLE MOMENT, UNDER THE MOON.</span><strong>今天，又发现了什么有趣的事？</strong><p>把日常、灵感和小小烦恼，留给这片月光。<br/>这片月光里，陪你听歌、阅读和发呆。</p><small>月光已就位，等你开场。</small></div></div>
    <div class="companion-request-status"><p class="companion-feedback" data-companion-feedback role="status"></p><button type="button" class="companion-quiet-button" data-companion-cancel hidden>取消等待</button></div>
    <form class="companion-chat-form" data-companion-form><label class="sr-only" for="companion-input">给小伙伴的消息</label><textarea id="companion-input" data-companion-input rows="2" maxlength="4000" placeholder="今天有什么新鲜事？（最多 4000 字）"></textarea><div><button class="companion-quiet-button" type="button" data-companion-clear>清空本次聊天</button><span>本次对话 · 最近 20 条</span><button class="companion-send" type="submit" data-companion-send>发送 ↗</button></div></form>
  </div>
  <div class="companion-tab-body companion-observe" id="companion-observe" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="companion-observe-tab" hidden>
    <div class="companion-privacy-note"><b>你授权，才观察。</b><p>默认关闭。只记录本站导航、文章标题、阅读进度和主题／分类切换。不记录键盘、输入框、聊天内容、剪贴板或后台编辑内容。</p></div>
    <label class="companion-optin"><input type="checkbox" data-companion-observe-toggle/><span>开启本标签页的站内观察<small>只保存在本标签页，关闭即停止</small></span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></label>
    <div class="companion-observe-status"><span data-companion-observe-state>观察已关闭 · 0 条</span><button type="button" class="companion-quiet-button" data-companion-events-clear>清空记录</button></div>
    <ol class="companion-event-list" data-companion-events aria-label="站内观察记录"></ol>
    <button class="companion-action" type="button" data-companion-analyze disabled>查看摘要，分析本次浏览 ↗</button>
    <div class="companion-analysis-review" data-companion-analysis-review hidden><b>发送前确认</b><p>仅下方路径、标题、操作时间及阅读进度会交给已配置的 AI 服务；不是持续监视。</p><pre data-companion-analysis-summary></pre><small data-companion-destination></small><div><button type="button" data-companion-analyze-cancel class="companion-quiet-button">取消</button><button type="button" data-companion-analyze-confirm class="companion-send">确认发送摘要分析</button></div></div>
    <div class="companion-screen-box"><h3>只看一张你选择的画面</h3><p>浏览器会让你选择屏幕或窗口。捕获单帧后立即结束共享，预览不会自动发送；可能包含敏感信息，请先检查。</p><button class="companion-action secondary" type="button" data-companion-capture>选择共享画面并预览</button><div class="companion-image-review" data-companion-image-review hidden><img data-companion-image alt="你选择共享的单帧画面预览，尚未发送"/><p>请检查密码、姓名、聊天等隐私；此画面将交给你的 AI 服务分析，且模型需要支持视觉。</p><small data-companion-image-destination></small><div><button type="button" class="companion-quiet-button" data-companion-image-cancel>取消并清除</button><button type="button" class="companion-send" data-companion-image-confirm disabled>确认发送这张画面分析</button></div></div></div>
    <p class="companion-feedback" data-companion-observe-feedback role="status"></p>
  </div>
  <div class="companion-tab-body companion-info" id="companion-info" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="companion-info-tab" hidden><span class="companion-info-art">☾ <i>ABOUT THIS CHANNEL</i> ✦</span><h3>稍微偷懒，也认真陪你。</h3><p>使用你提供的八千代 Live2D；人格参考《超时空辉夜姬！》月见八千代，属于非官方原创角色扮演。公开站仅提供角色互动。</p><dl><div><dt>能做什么</dt><dd>Live2D 动作、触摸台词、拖动与缩放；不发送聊天或画面。</dd></div><div><dt>不会做什么</dt><dd>不后台录屏，不监听按键，不读取任意窗口，不自动操作电脑，不记录后台文章内容。</dd></div><div><dt>数据去哪里</dt><dd>经本机服务转发到你设置的模型接口；API key 只留在服务端。聊天在本页内存中，刷新清空。</dd></div><div><dt>动效与位置</dt><dd>拖动调整位置，尺寸可选 55%–120%，默认 75%。隐藏或切到后台时暂停动作。</dd></div></dl><fieldset class="companion-live2d-controls" data-live2d-controls><legend>Live2D / 角色显示</legend><label>显示模式<select data-live2d-mode aria-label="角色显示模式"><option value="yachiyo">八千代 · Live2D</option><option value="portrait">八千代 · 静态头像（非 Live2D）</option><option value="kaguya">辉夜 · 旧版分层 2D（非 Cubism）</option><option value="haru">Haru · 官方技术演示</option><option value="custom" disabled>本地授权模型（本页导入）</option></select></label><p data-live2d-status role="status">正在载入八千代 Live2D…</p><div class="companion-live2d-buttons"><button type="button" data-live2d-motion>轻轻点头</button><button type="button" data-live2d-expression>切换表情</button><button type="button" data-live2d-pause aria-pressed="false">暂停动作</button></div><label class="companion-live2d-import">选择已获授权的模型目录<input type="file" data-live2d-import webkitdirectory multiple aria-label="选择包含 .model3.json、.moc3、纹理和动作的授权模型目录"/></label><small>模型由你提供；发布前请确认授权。<a href="/live2d/README.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">模型与运行库许可 ↗</a></small></fieldset><div class="companion-dialogue-setting"><label><input type="checkbox" data-companion-dialogue-toggle checked aria-describedby="companion-dialogue-status"/>八千代台词气泡</label><p id="companion-dialogue-status" data-companion-dialogue-status>早晚问候、听歌互动与轻触台词；不调用 AI，可随时关闭。</p></div><label class="companion-scale-control"><span>小伙伴尺寸</span><output data-companion-scale-value for="companion-scale">75%</output><input id="companion-scale" data-companion-scale type="range" min="55" max="120" step="5" value="75" aria-label="小伙伴尺寸，百分比"/><small>隐藏、尺寸与位置保存在本机；换页继续保留。</small></label><div class="companion-info-links"><a href="/credits/">素材与非官方声明 ↗</a></div><button class="companion-action secondary" type="button" data-companion-reset-position>重置小伙伴位置</button></div>
</section>
<div class="companion-particles" data-companion-particles aria-hidden="true"></div>
<script is:inline src="/companion-dialogue.js" defer></script>
<script is:inline src="/companion.js" defer></script>
<script is:inline type="module" src="/live2d-companion.js"></script>
